 with four private words and no native resource.\nEqual explicit seeds and call sequences replay exactly. Gameplay use only, never cryptography.\nAssignment snapshots the stream; mutating draws require writable receiver storage.","kind":7,"label":"generator","textEdit":{"newText":"generator","range":{"end":{"character":19,"line":2},"start":{"character":19,"line":2}}}},{"detail":"public rand_f32() -> f32\nrand_f32(maximum: f32) -> f32\nrand_f32(lower: f32, upper: f32) -> f32\nBounded forms are direct calls; function values retain the declared signature.\nEffects: pending analysis","documentation":"Draw f32 from the shared Runtime default; first needed draw initializes from OS entropy.\nDirect calls support zero arguments, maximum for [0, maximum), or lower/upper for [lower, upper).\nZero arguments sample [0, 1) with 24 high random bits.\n\nReturns: Sample; invalid arguments or entropy failures raise checked Runtime failure.","kind":3,"label":"rand_f32","textEdit":{"newText":"rand_f32","range":{"end":{"character":19,"line":2},"start":{"character":19,"line":2}}}},{"detail":"public rand_f64() -> f64\nrand_f64(maximum: f64) -> f64\nrand_f64(lower: f64, upper: f64) -> f64\nBounded forms are direct calls; function values retain the declared signature.\nEffects: pending analysis","documentation":"Draw f64 from the shared Runtime default; first needed draw initializes from OS entropy.\nDirect calls support zero arguments, maximum for [0, maximum), or lower/upper for [lower, upper).\nZero arguments sample [0, 1) with 53 high random bits.\n\nReturns: Sample; invalid arguments or entropy failures raise checked Runtime failure.","kind":3,"label":"rand_f64","textEdit":{"newText":"rand_f64","range":{"end":{"character":19,"line":2},"start":{"character":19,"line":2}}}},{"detail":"public rand_i16() -> i16\nrand_i16(maximum: i16) -> i16\nrand_i16(lower: i16, upper: i16) -> i16\nBounded forms are direct calls; function values retain the declared signature.\nEffects: pending analysis","